---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Smart Geotecnia | Arietis Software</title>
    <meta name="description" content="App de ingeniería geotécnica offline para registro de calicatas y ensayos in-situ." />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="hero">
        <div class="topo-background"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
            <span class="badge">BETA GRATUITA</span>
            
            <img src="/logo.png" alt="Logo Smart Geotecnia" class="app-logo" />
            
            <h1>Smart Geotecnia</h1>
            <p>La evolución del trabajo en terreno por <strong>Arietis Software</strong></p>
            
            <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1x81Sckm3wGcDPxrRur7z7mXRrYkp02SM/view?usp=sharing" class="btn-download" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line></svg>
                Descargar APK
            </a>
            <span class="disclaimer">*Android solicitará permisos de orígenes desconocidos.</span>
        </div>
    </main>

    <section class="content">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Ingeniería Geotécnica 100% Offline</h2>
            <p class="subtitle">Diseñada para agilizar el registro estratigráfico, ensayos de permeabilidad y geofísica en faena, sin depender de la señal celular.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14.531 12.469L6.619 20.38a1 1 0 1 1-1.414-1.414l7.912-7.912"></path><path d="M15.686 4.314A3.429 3.429 0 0 0 10.835 4L8.5 6.336l9.164 9.164 2.336-2.336a3.428 3.428 0 0 0-.314-4.851z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Estándar FT-06</h3>
                <p>Descripciones estratigráficas automáticas y normadas para suelos gruesos y finos.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Data Logger Inteligente</h3>
                <p>Análisis de curva en tiempo real para ensayos Porchet e Índice de Absorción.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="icon-wrapper">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><path d="M8 13h.01"></path><path d="M12 13h.01"></path><path d="M16 13h.01"></path><path d="M8 17h.01"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path><path d="M16 17h.01"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Exportación Total</h3>
                <p>Genera reportes CSV, KMZ y anexo fotográfico estructurado en un solo archivo ZIP.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <p class="feedback-text">¿Tienes dudas o feedback sobre la Beta?</p>
            <a href="mailto:contacto@arietisgeo.cl" class="btn-contact">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline></svg>
                contacto@arietisgeo.cl
            </a>
            <p class="copyright">&copy; 2026 Arietis Software</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>

<style>
    :root {
        --primary-color: #f59e0b; /* Amber para el CTA principal */
        --primary-hover: #d97706;
        --bg-dark: #111827;
        --bg-light: #f9fafb;
        --text-main: #1f2937;
        --text-muted: #6b7280;
        --card-border: #e5e7eb;
    }
    
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    
    body {
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: var(--bg-light);
        color: var(--text-main);
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
        position: relative;
        background-color: var(--bg-dark);
        color: white;
        padding: 80px 20px 100px;
        text-align: center;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .topo-background {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
        opacity: 0.05;
        background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='100' height='100' viewBox='0 0 100 100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cpath d='M11 18c3.866 0 7-3.134 7-7s-3.134-7-7-7-7 3.134-7 7 3.134 7 7 7zm48 25c3.866 0 7-3.134 7-7s-3.134-7-7-7-7 3.134-7 7 3.134 7 7 7zm-43-7c1.657 0 3-1.343 3-3s-1.343-3-3-3-3 1.343-3 3 1.343 3 3 3zm63 31c1.657 0 3-1.343 3-3s-1.343-3-3-3-3 1.343-3 3 1.343 3 3 3zM34 90c1.657 0 3-1.343 3-3s-1.343-3-3-3-3 1.343-3 3 1.343 3 3 3zm56-76c1.657 0 3-1.343 3-3s-1.343-3-3-3-3 1.343-3 3 1.343 3 3 3zM12 86c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm28-65c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm23-11c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5-5 2.24-5 5 2.24 5 5 5zm-6 60c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm29 22c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5-5 2.24-5 5 2.24 5 5 5zM32 63c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5-5 2.24-5 5 2.24 5 5 5zm57-13c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5-5 2.24-5 5 2.24 5 5 5zm-9-21c1.105 0 2-.895 2-2s-.895-2-2-2-2 .895-2 2 .895 2 2 2zM60 91c1.105 0 2-.895 2-2s-.895-2-2-2-2 .895-2 2 .895 2 2 2zM35 41c1.105 0 2-.895 2-2s-.895-2-2-2-2 .895-2 2 .895 2 2 2zM12 60c1.105 0 2-.895 2-2s-.895-2-2-2-2 .895-2 2 .895 2 2 2z' fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='1' fill-rule='evenodd'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    }

    .hero-content {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 10;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }

    /* Minimalist Glassmorphism Badge */
    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        color: #e5e7eb;
        padding: 4px 14px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    /* App Logo Styling */
    .app-logo {
        width: 140px;
        height: auto;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        border-radius: 28px;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .hero h1 { 
        margin: 0; 
        font-size: 3.5rem; 
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -1px;
        background: linear-gradient(to right, #fff, #d1d5db);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    
    .hero p { 
        font-size: 1.15rem; 
        margin-top: 12px; 
        color: #9ca3af;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    .hero p strong { color: white; }
    
    .btn-download {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        background-color: var(--primary-color);
        color: var(--bg-dark);
        padding: 16px 32px;
        margin-top: 32px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 800;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    
    .btn-download:hover {
        background-color: var(--primary-hover);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    }

    .disclaimer {
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        margin-top: 20px;
        color: #6b7280;
    }

    /* Features Section - Corrección de márgenes */
    .content {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 60px auto 80px; /* Se eliminó el margen negativo */
        padding: 0 20px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 20;
    }

    .section-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .subtitle { 
        font-size: 1.1rem; 
        color: var(--text-muted); 
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .features {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
    }

    .feature-card {
        background: white;
        padding: 40px 30px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        text-align: left;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
    }

    .icon-wrapper { 
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        background-color: #f3f4f6; /* Tono neutral sutil */
        color: #4b5563; /* Gris oscuro elegante */
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .icon-wrapper svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; }

    .feature-card h3 { 
        margin: 0 0 12px 0; 
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--text-main);
    }
    
    .feature-card p { 
        font-size: 1rem; 
        color: var(--text-muted); 
        margin: 0; 
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
        background-color: white;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .footer-content {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        text-align: center;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .feedback-text {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--text-main);
        margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .btn-contact {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        color: var(--text-main);
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        transition: all 0.2s ease;
        background-color: white;
    }

    .btn-contact:hover {
        border-color: var(--text-muted);
        background-color: #f9fafb;
    }

    .copyright { 
        font-size: 0.9rem; 
        margin-top: 40px; 
        color: var(--text-muted); 
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
        .hero { padding: 60px 20px 80px; }
        .app-logo { width: 100px; }
    }
</style>